  {
    "id": "cn.regex.advanced.simile-like",
    "namespace": "regex.advanced",
    "title": "正则-高级替换",
    "level": "medium",
    "enabled": false,
    "note": "默认关闭：单个“像/仿佛……一样”不是稳定 AI 味，当前 eval 为 noise；比喻问题改由 metaphor human 桶和 story-deslop.metaphor-density 处理。",
    "source": {
